<title>UK: B.A.T to unveil demerger plans-paper.</title>
<headline>B.A.T to unveil demerger plans-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British financial services and tobacco group B.A.T Industries Plc will soon announce plans for a full demerger to be completed by next year, the Guardian said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The paper said documents were circulating around London's business district indicating that the company has decided that its financial operations are strong enough to stand alone.</p>
<p>The Guardian said that B.A.T is likely to announce later this month a restructuring of its three life and investment firms. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
